# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
#
# Ignore rules.
#
# Two directories in the working tree are deliberately *not* part of this
# repository:
#
#   queqiao/  a pristine checkout of the upstream project, kept around as a
#             reference.  It is a git repository of its own, so committing it
#             would create an embedded repository inside this one.
#   .tmp/     scratch space: experiment code, build artefacts, a vendored
#             libbpf tarball and extracted kernel sources.  Large, and it
#             contains third party source that does not belong here.
#
# Everything that is generated (build output, object files, editor and OS
# noise) is excluded as well.  Documentation under docs/ is tracked.

# --- reference checkout of the upstream project -------------------------
/queqiao/

# --- scratch space ------------------------------------------------------
/.tmp/

# --- build output -------------------------------------------------------
build/
_build/
out/
*.o
*.so
*.so.*
*.a
*.la
*.lo
*.bpf.o
*.o.d
*.d
*.elf
*.ko
*.mod
*.mod.c
*.symvers
*.order
.*.cmd

